title: "QGF Score Specification v0.1: Question Gravitational Field Score"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-05-17"
type: software
license: MIT

authors:
  - name: "Shidenkai Alpha"

abstract: >
  QGF Score Specification v0.1 defines a minimal structural measurement model
  for estimating the Question Gravitational Field of a question. It provides
  parameters, field classes, examples, schema validation, and measurement
  procedures for observing how strongly a question attracts AI responses,
  trace records, structural fingerprints, lineage relations, and civilizational
  discourse.

